    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12513" root="درى" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُرْيَةٌ</span></b> , accord. to some copies of the S, is an
inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرَيْتُهُ</span> meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِمْتُهُ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِرْيَةٌ</span> &amp;c. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتَى هٰذَا الأَمْرُ مِنْ غَيْرِ دُرْيَةٍ</span> means <i>This thing,</i>
or <i>event, came without any act,</i> or <i>deed.</i> (T,
TA.)

